~ intro
NPC: [[Status: Corrupted...|System Error...|Runtime Exception...]]
NPC: ...Hello? Is someone there? I can't... I can't find my coordinates.
Tracy: I'm Tracy. I'm a developer. I'm here to fix the game.
NPC: The Developer?! You finally connected!
NPC: We've been invaded. These glitches... they scuttled into our source code and stole our logic.
Tracy: So that's why the game is unplayable. 
NPC: Yes! They've manifested as physical Bugs. They are holding our Logic Blocks hostage.
NPC: Please, Tracy. Hunt them down, recapture the blocks, and use your Inspector to patch us.
=> END

